  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "Here's how blue green deployment works."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Your shop is about to ship version two point zero."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Deploy it straight onto the live servers, and checkout breaks for every customer."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "So instead, you run two identical environments behind one load balancer."
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "Blue is live and serves every request, while green sits idle."
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "Now deploy version two point zero to green, where no user can reach it."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "Then test it privately, through its own address."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "Every check passes, so you flip the switch."
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "All traffic moves to green at once, with zero downtime."
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "Five minutes later, checkout errors jump to eighteen percent."
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "Blue never went away, so you flip straight back."
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "Every customer is safe again within seconds."
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "One environment live, one ready, and a single switch between them."
    }
  ],
